OL,3,GNEWSAFree school travel for SEND
OL,4,Ateenagers under threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree travel for children with special
OL,7,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,8,F(SEND) could soon end, as a council
OL,9,Fsays it faces significant financial
OL,10,Fpressures.
OL,12,FSwindon Borough Council is consulting
OL,13,Fon whether it should introduce an
OL,14,Fannual fee for its SEND home-to-school
OL,15,Ftransport service, for young people
OL,16,Faged 16 to 18.
OL,18,FThe service is currently provided free
OL,19,Fof charge, but the council says this is
OL,20,Fnot required by law and they receive no
OL,21,Fgovernment funding to deliver it.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
